WEBVTT

00:00:12.692 --> 00:00:15.653
Will we die just a little?

00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:27.915
Hey.

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:32.253
I figured somebody ought to
keep an eye on this thing.

00:00:36.924 --> 00:00:37.925
Thank you.

00:00:38.092 --> 00:00:40.720
We owe you an apology, Mr. Scamander,

00:00:41.637 --> 00:00:44.056
but the magical community is exposed.

00:00:44.974 --> 00:00:47.560
We cannot Obliviate an entire city.

00:00:52.857 --> 00:00:54.108
NEWT: Actually,

00:00:55.651 --> 00:00:57.111
I think we can.

00:01:05.494 --> 00:01:06.495
(SCREECHING)

00:01:06.746 --> 00:01:07.788
(ALL GASP)

00:01:23.053 --> 00:01:25.890
I was intending to wait
until we got to Arizona.

00:01:29.226 --> 00:01:32.021
But it seems that now
you're our only hope, Frank.

00:01:37.818 --> 00:01:38.819
(SQUAWKS)

00:01:51.207 --> 00:01:52.792
NEWT: I'll miss you, too.

00:01:56.003 --> 00:01:58.756
(SCREECHING)

00:02:05.262 --> 00:02:06.722
You know what you gotta do.

00:02:16.065 --> 00:02:17.107
-(ALL GASPING)
-(PEOPLE SCREAMING)

00:02:18.192 --> 00:02:19.193
(GASPS)

00:02:31.831 --> 00:02:33.040
(LIGHTNING CRASHES)

00:02:33.207 --> 00:02:35.042
-(WIND WHOOSHING)
-(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:03:50.951 --> 00:03:53.787
DESTRUCTION IN TIMES SQUARE
MAGICAL CREATURE WREAKS HAVOC

00:03:53.954 --> 00:03:56.457
UNUSUAL WEATHER PATTERN STRIKES NEW YORK
WETTEST NOVEMBER IN LIVING MEMORY

00:04:18.145 --> 00:04:19.855
(SCREECHING)

00:04:28.405 --> 00:04:30.491
(THUNDER RUMBLING)

00:04:33.077 --> 00:04:34.411
CITY HALL

00:04:34.578 --> 00:04:36.163
NEWT: They won't remember anything.

00:04:37.331 --> 00:04:40.668
That venom has incredibly powerful
Obliviative properties.

00:04:43.212 --> 00:04:45.506
We owe you a great debt, Mr. Scamander.

00:04:48.592 --> 00:04:49.718
Now,

00:04:49.885 --> 00:04:52.012
get that case out of New York.

00:04:52.721 --> 00:04:54.139
Yes, Madam President.

00:05:00.688 --> 00:05:02.356
Is that No-Maj still here?

00:05:07.486 --> 00:05:08.862
Obliviate him.

00:05:09.029 --> 00:05:10.447
There can be no exceptions.

00:05:12.825 --> 00:05:15.244
I'm sorry, but even one witness...

00:05:15.411 --> 00:05:16.537
You know the law.

00:05:20.791 --> 00:05:22.710
I'll let you say goodbye.

00:05:23.711 --> 00:05:25.838
SUBWAY

00:05:33.846 --> 00:05:34.972
Hey.

00:05:35.764 --> 00:05:36.765
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:37.641 --> 00:05:38.642
This is for the best.

00:05:39.977 --> 00:05:41.854
Yeah. I was...

00:05:43.105 --> 00:05:45.149
I was never even supposed to be here.

00:05:46.108 --> 00:05:47.901
(VOICE BREAKING)
I was never supposed to know

00:05:49.862 --> 00:05:51.238
any of this.

00:05:51.655 --> 00:05:52.906
(SNIFFLES)

00:05:55.868 --> 00:05:58.245
Everybody knows Newt only
kept me around because...

00:06:00.164 --> 00:06:01.248
Hey,

00:06:01.582 --> 00:06:04.376
Newt, why did you keep me around?

00:06:05.961 --> 00:06:07.421
Because I like you.

00:06:09.798 --> 00:06:11.675
Because you're my friend.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:15.429
And I'll never forget
how you helped me, Jacob.

00:06:16.764 --> 00:06:18.098
(VOICE BREAKING) Oh...

00:06:18.766 --> 00:06:19.767
Hey...

00:06:20.225 --> 00:06:21.435
I'll come with you.

00:06:21.727 --> 00:06:22.770
(BOTH CHUCKLING)

00:06:23.103 --> 00:06:25.230
We'll go somewhere. We'll go anywhere.

00:06:25.397 --> 00:06:26.440
(LAUGHS WEAKLY)

00:06:26.607 --> 00:06:27.775
See,

00:06:28.025 --> 00:06:30.819
I ain't never gonna find anyone like you.

00:06:33.739 --> 00:06:34.907
There's loads like me.

00:06:35.074 --> 00:06:36.116
No.

00:06:37.034 --> 00:06:38.035
No.

00:06:39.411 --> 00:06:41.205
There's only one like you.

00:06:47.461 --> 00:06:48.962
I gotta go.

00:06:51.632 --> 00:06:53.509
(SNIFFLES)

00:06:53.801 --> 00:06:54.885
Jacob...

00:06:55.803 --> 00:06:57.471
It's okay. It's okay.

00:07:00.474 --> 00:07:01.809
It's okay.

00:07:04.353 --> 00:07:05.813
(SIGHS DEEPLY)

00:07:06.355 --> 00:07:08.357
It's just like waking up, right?

